# Lint and format what's being committed, so the guardrails can't rot between
# CI runs. Only staged files, so the hook stays fast enough not to be skipped.
#
# Typecheck and tests are deliberately not here: both read the whole project and
# take long enough that people start reaching for --no-verify, which costs more
# than it saves. CI runs all four on every push and PR.
npx lint-staged
